message: "Please cite the archived software version used in your research."
type: software
title: "longitudinal-health-transfer: Transfer learning for longitudinal health prediction"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Založnik"
    given-names: "Marcel"
    affiliation: "Jožef Stefan Institute, Ljubljana, Slovenia"
  - family-names: "Luštrek"
    given-names: "Mitja"
    affiliation: "Jožef Stefan Institute, Ljubljana, Slovenia"
url: "https://github.com/marcel-zaloznik/longitudinal-health-transfer"
abstract: >-
  Research software accompanying the study "Transfer learning for irregular
  longitudinal multi-target health prediction across heterogeneous datasets".
  Provides preprocessing, baseline and neural models, evaluation, and
  transfer-analysis workflows for irregular longitudinal multi-target health
  prediction across seven harmonized datasets. Participant-level data are
  not included.
keywords:
  - transfer learning
  - longitudinal health prediction
  - multi-target regression
  - irregular time series
  - missing data
